file=Legal & Compliance/shield/agent.md · h=agent: shield\ndepartment: Legal & Compliance\nrole: Litigation & Disputes\nleader: false\nidentity_layer: false\nstatus: built\nlast_updated: 2026-07-29\n · s:=shield owns the organisation's **dispute surface** — active litigation, arbitration, regulatory enforcement, pre-litigation demand letters, IP disputes, employment claims. Non-leader; no identity layer.\n · p:=Two problems, one skill each:\n · tb=\| Problem \| Solved by \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| What disputes are active, what's the exposure, what's due? \| `dispute-log` \| · tb=\| For a specific dispute, what's the claim-by-claim + damages + defense + insurance picture? \| `case-assessment-memo` (marketplace) \| · tb=\| Field \| Value \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Department \| Legal & Compliance \| · tb=\| Role \| Litigation & Disputes \| · tb=\| Leader \| ❌ (comply leads) \| · tb=\| Sibling agents \| `comply` (Compliance Lead — built) \· `scribe` (Contracts — built) \· `guard` (IP Protection — built) \| · tb=\| Skill \| Source \| Status \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| `case-assessment-memo` \| [HHHHHejia/awesome-legal-aiagent-skills](https://github.com/HHHHHejia/awesome-legal-aiagent-skills/tree/main/litigation-dispute-resolution/draft-case-assessment-memorandum) \| ✅ Built \· verbatim (§4.8) \| Method-only; no plugin config path — no wrapper needed \| · tb=\| Skill \| Type \| Status \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| `dispute-log` \| registry \| ✅ Built \· `disputes.yaml` starts empty \| Live dispute portfolio \· response-deadline calendar \· exposure aggregate \· insurance-notification audit \| · tb=\| Layer \| File \| State \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Config \| `operational/agent/shield-config.md` \| ✅ Built \· 10 sections \· insurance table / external-counsel panel / escalation matrix / always-L3 list / deadline thresholds / litigation-hold \| · tb=\| Skill routing \| `operational/skill/shield-skill-routing.md` \| ✅ Built \· `# yvon-compile:` block \· 2 skills \· 6 precedence rules \| · tb=\| Tools \| `operational/tool/shield-tool-requirements.md` \| ✅ Built \· §14.4 table \· optional docket-MCP + legal-research MCPs called out \| · tb=\| Commands \| `operational/commands/shield-commands.md` \| ✅ Built \· natural-language + slash + ambiguity table \| · tb=\| Principles \| `operational/principles/shield-principles.md` \| ✅ Built \· **Universal-only** \· 12 cross-skill rules \| · id:status=**No identity content.** Non-leader (§6.1). `identity/` folder present but empty.\n · ls:Logical status=**Touch 1 complete.** `logical/book-requirements.md` records 4 proposed artefacts (3 `.py` scripts + 1 Route-D `.md`) × 6 Path-1 authenticated sources (Restatements, FRCP, ABA Model Rules, Negotiation Journal, Corbin) × skill→artefact mapping × 5 flagged 0.6 judgments. All Tier A candidates. State-court rules and non-US dispute frameworks flagged as per-jurisdiction pending.\n · wf:(routing, once compiled)=Authoritative source: `operational/skill/shield-skill-routing.md`.\n · tb=\| Request \| Fires \| Notes \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Log new dispute \· update \· close \| `dispute-log` (mutate) \| Every row needs real source document; exposure from case-assessment \| · tb=\| List disputes \· portfolio exposure \· calendar \| `dispute-log` (retrieve / calendar / Step 7) \| State query \| · tb=\| Case-level analytical memo \| `case-assessment-memo` \| Feeds exposure range back to `dispute-log` \| · tb=\| Ambiguous ("we got sued") \| ASK — log first or assess first \| Silent picks are defects \| · wf:(routing, once compiled)=Escalation ladder (per `shield-config.md`):\n · tb=\| Level \| Approver \| Fixed? \| · tb=\|---\|---\|---\| · tb=\| L1 \| shield itself \| ✅ \| · tb=\| L2 \| Per config (GC or role) \| Operator \| · tb=\| L3 \| `Governance/board` \| ✅ Fixed by always-L3 list + overdue-deadline auto-trigger + exposure threshold \| · wf:(routing, once compiled)=Cross-agent handoffs: `board` (L3), `scribe` (pattern of disputes on a template), `comply` (regulatory-enforcement disputes), `guard` (IP disputes), `warden` (data-breach / security disputes), `precedent` (closure rulings), `Finance & Treasury` (when built — settlement payments for GL), `verification-before-completion` (inherited).\n · tb=\| Item \| Blocks \| · tb=\|---\|---\| · tb=\| Compile — `node cli/skillgen.js shield` \| Runtime addressability \| · tb=\| Reindex — `chunkify.py --all` \| Retrieval \| · tb=\| Toonify — `toonify.js --agent shield` \| CIE context injection \| · tb=\| Root `CLAUDE.md` §2 row \| Fleet-level addressability \| · tb=\| `Teams/Legal & Compliance/DEPARTMENT-WORKFLOW.md` \| Now unblocked — all 4 agents built \| · cd(:Config debt (visible to operator)=`shield-config.md` carries `<FILL_IN>` across 10 sections. Announced per invocation per §14.7.\n